#### Project rc file for this repo's custom/analog cells.
####
#### Why it exists: a cell in one directory has to be able to instantiate
#### a symbol from another — a ring oscillator instantiating inv/inv.sym
#### is the whole reason symbols exist. xschem resolves a reference like
#### "inv/inv.sym" against XSCHEM_LIBRARY_PATH, and the PDK's own rcfile
#### flushes that path and adds only its own directories, so without this
#### every cell here is an island ("inv IS MISSING !!!!" in the netlist,
#### which is how this was found).
####
#### The PDK's rcfile is sourced rather than copied: everything it sets
#### up (SKYWATER_MODELS, the sky130_fd_pr symbol library, colours) still
#### applies, and this file adds exactly one thing on top.

source $env(PDK_ROOT)/$env(PDK)/libs.tech/xschem/xschemrc

#### This directory, as a library root. `info script` is this file, so
#### the path is right whether the tree is mounted at /design in a
#### container or read in place on a host with xschem installed.
append XSCHEM_LIBRARY_PATH :[file dirname [info script]]
